---
// Componente de Versículo Bíblico
---
<section class="bg-white overflow-hidden">
    <div class="reveal max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-2 mb-6">
            <div class="w-1 h-1 bg-boda-arena rounded-full"></div>
            <div class="w-1 h-1 bg-boda-arena rounded-full"></div>
            <div class="w-1 h-1 bg-boda-arena rounded-full"></div>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="relative">
            <p class="font-serif text-2md md:text-3md text-gray-700 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">
                "Uno solo puede ser vencido pero dos presentan resistencia, el cordón de tres hilos no se rompe fácilmente."
            </p>
            
            <footer class="font-sans">
                <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-boda-verde font-semibold">
                    Eclesiastés 4:12
                </span>
            </footer>
        </blockquote>

        <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-[1px] bg-boda-arena/50"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>